{
  "recordedAt": "2026-09-22T15:06:30.325324+00:00",
  "scope": "Linux x64 runtime-library metadata repair and ordinary Lean.Runtime import. Original upstream tests and supplementary packaged/native controls; not complete-suite or API conformance.",
  "findings": [
    "The v144 broad Node campaign exposed a fabricated 1.48.0 libuv version. Unmodified elab/libuv.lean expects pinned upstream Emscripten metadata (zero). The paused campaign retains 1629 passes and that failure.",
    "The full runtime no longer overrides lean_libuv_version. A byte-identical copy of upstream libuv.cpp is compiled with only its existing initialization redirect; native-library version reporting uses upstream code.",
    "The packaged WASI guest now reports zero native libuv/OpenSSL versions. Its missing lean_openssl_version previously prevented ordinary Lean.Runtime imports from linking. Host API adapters do not constitute native libraries inside the guest.",
    "The same ordinary Lean fixture records native library versions, reproduces old full-engine version metadata, and verifies corrected full-engine values. Emscripten/WASI/native platform metadata remains target-dependent.",
    "All 21 unchanged upstream registrations pass (seven per engine), including libuv, OpenSSL, ordinary IO, HTTP hang regressions, system information, directory reads and clocks. All 7267 source hashes remain intact.",
    "The new packaged metadata test and six existing IO/main tests pass. Released Node, Deno and Bun each run the repaired packaged main successfully."
  ],
  "retainedDevelopmentAttempts": [
    "The first supplementary package test failed at link time on missing lean_openssl_version before reaching its libuv assertion. An explicit OpenSSL output assertion was then added to this supplementary fixture; no upstream source/test was changed.",
    "Initial generated package fixture artifacts were moved intact into .work/full-engine-probe/runtime-metadata-initial-fixture-lake. The maintained test now copies its source into an isolated temporary project."
  ],
  "remainingGaps": [
    "Full Node/Deno/Bun suites remain incomplete. New-profile targeted results are not imported into the paused older campaign.",
    "Full Bun uses the disclosed local memory64-capacity build and Linux stack helper; packaged checks use released Bun.",
    "UV loop configuration/aliveness, broader IO behavior, packaged full-runtime integration and native cross-platform validation remain open; this metadata repair does not establish those capabilities."
  ],
